# expect: reject PLN-11 PLN-12
# Plan 16 with module 3 input 0 at 200 Hz instead of 100: total 22700 Hz, 227 samples per frame,
# 2002400 bit/s, just over the 2 Mbit/s link. Catches leaving out IMU channels (would be 19900 Hz),
# a 2^21 bit/s link, or dropping the 66 B of UDP/IP/Ethernet overhead.
# CAN: heartbeat 4 B = 8*4+47+floor(65/4)=95 bit; data 8 B = 8*8+47+floor(97/4)=135 bit
# CAN: modules used 3 -> 3*95 = 285 bit/s; groups m1g0@1000, m1g1@1000, m1g2@1000, m1g3@1000, m2g0@1000, m2g1@1000, m2g2@500, m2g3@200, m3g0@200
# CAN: sum of group rates 6900 Hz -> 6900*135 = 931500 bit/s; total 931785 bit/s = 186.357 % of 500 kbit/s (limit 300000)
# TLM: total sample rate 22700 Hz -> 227 samples per 10 ms frame -> 5 packet(s); 9*227 + 5*(22+4+66) = 2503 B/frame * 100 * 8 = 2002400 bit/s (limit 2000000)
iqk-plan 1
campaign blind1_c01
channel imu_gyro_x imu:gyro_x rate=400
